      <p style="text-indent: 1em" rend="first-line-indent(1)" source="#source-869-1216"><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-872-884"><rb>畫</rb><rt>ゑ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-884-887">を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-887-899"><rb>好</rb><rt>す</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-899-905">かぬ</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-905-926"><rb>小供</rb><rt>こども</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-926-929">は</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-929-941"><rb>先</rb><rt>ま</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-941-944">づ</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-944-959"><rb>少</rb><rt>すく</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-959-974">ないとして</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-974-998"><rb>其中</rb><rt>そのうち</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-998-1004">にも</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1004-1025"><rb>自分</rb><rt>じぶん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1025-1028">は</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1028-1049"><rb>小供</rb><rt>こども</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1049-1052">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1052-1067"><rb>時</rb><rt>とき</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1067-1070">、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1070-1085"><rb>何</rb><rt>なに</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1085-1094">よりも</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1094-1106"><rb>畫</rb><rt>ゑ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1106-1109">が</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1109-1121"><rb>好</rb><rt>す</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1121-1145">きであつた。（と</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1145-1178"><rb>岡本某</rb><rt>をかもとぼう</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1178-1181">が</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1181-1196"><rb>語</rb><rt>かた</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1196-1216">りだした）。</seg></p>
